library(shiny)
library(bslib)

## UI Design

The following section presents the overall user interface design for the proposed Shiny application. The application adopts a sidebar-and-main-panel layout to provide a clear and consistent user experience. The left sidebar is used for navigation across analytical modules, while the main panel is designed to display visual outputs, statistical results, and explanatory content.

### Storyboard

```{r, echo=FALSE, out.width='100%'}
library(htmltools)

browsable(
  div(
    style = "display:flex; min-height:700px; font-family:Arial, sans-serif; background:#f5f5f5; border:1px solid #ddd;",

